    "turn_text": "Yeah, for sure. I think across the country, people are feeling that and just like want to trust who they're voting for. And yeah, I think we have some great candidates hoping on the ballot across the country who are showing that to people which is good. Well, before we wrap, I'm curious what you suggest for people to look out for in New Jersey when it comes to this election and just generally like I guess closing notes on how we like are in this final push in this crunch time of October, like what you suggest people do or focus on or just like put their energy towards.",
